# CR 702.16k: protection from a player covers the objects that player controls, whoever owns them. On turn 4 Bot2 gains
# control of Bot1's own Llanowar Elves with Act of Treason and attacks Bot1 with it: the Elves are Bot2's, so their combat
# damage to Bot1 is prevented by Absolute Virtue's protection.

