Forest
Llanowar Elves
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Absolute Virtue
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Act of Treason
Island x16

